<<endif>>
===

title: Marty_Breakroom
---
<<if $marty_breakroom_visited == false>>
    <<set $marty_breakroom_visited = true>>
    <<jump Marty_Breakroom_FirstVisit>>
<<else>>
    <<jump Marty_Breakroom_Loop>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Marty_Breakroom_FirstVisit
//setting: breakroom with marty & gray
